# Generated TypeScript event bindings must stay LF-only.
#
# The `committed_events_gen_matches_export` drift-gate test (crates/harsh-core/
# src/payloads/client_event.rs) does an exact byte comparison of the committed
# file against `generate_ts_bindings()`, which always emits LF. Without pinning
# EOL, a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` would rewrite the file to
# CRLF and the gate would fail permanently. Pin it to LF on every platform.
frontend/src/types/events.gen.ts text eol=lf
